<PageLayout
	title="Privacy Policy"
	eyebrow="Legal"
	dek="How Arahkaii collects, uses and protects your personal data."
	description="Arahkaii's privacy policy — how we handle personal data under Singapore's PDPA. Published by ONN GROUP LLP."
>
	<p>
		Arahkaii is an editorial publication; we are not a shop and we do not process orders
		or payments. This policy explains the limited personal data we do collect, how we use
		it, and your rights under Singapore's Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA).
	</p>

	<h2>Who we are</h2>
	<p>
		Arahkaii is published by <strong>ONN GROUP LLP</strong>, 60 Paya Lebar Road, #06-28
		Paya Lebar Square, Singapore 409051. For any privacy question, write to
		<a href="mailto:hello@arahkaii.com">hello@arahkaii.com</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>What we collect</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Newsletter sign-ups</strong> — your email address (and name, if you give it).</li>
		<li><strong>Contact form</strong> — the name, email, subject and message you send us.</li>
		<li><strong>Usage data</strong> — basic, privacy-respecting analytics: pages viewed, approximate region, device and referrer.</li>
		<li><strong>Your reading list</strong> is stored only in your browser on your device — it never reaches us.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>How we use it</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>To send the Arahkaii Weekly newsletter, with your consent.</li>
		<li>To respond to your enquiries and partnership requests.</li>
		<li>To understand what readers value and improve the publication.</li>
		<li>To meet legal obligations where they apply.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Cookies &amp; service providers</h2>
	<p>
		We use a small number of trusted providers to run the site — hosting (Vercel),
		contact delivery (Resend), newsletter delivery (MailerLite or Beehiiv) and privacy-respecting analytics. They process data
		only on our behalf. We do <strong>not</strong> sell or rent your personal data. We
		disclose it only to these providers, or to authorities where the law requires.
	</p>

	<h2>Your rights under the PDPA</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Access the personal data we hold about you, and ask us to correct it.</li>
		<li>Withdraw consent — for example, unsubscribe from the newsletter at any time via the link in every email.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>To exercise any right, email <a href="mailto:hello@arahkaii.com">hello@arahkaii.com</a>.</p>

	<h2>Retention</h2>
	<p>
		We keep personal data only as long as needed for the purpose it was given — newsletter
		details until you unsubscribe, enquiries for as long as needed to handle them.
	</p>

	<h2>Changes</h2>
	<p>We may update this policy; revisions are posted here and take effect on publication.</p>

	<p class="pg-updated">Last updated: June 2026</p>
</PageLayout>
